    "title": "Joint operation leads to truck driver arrests in Colorado, Wyoming | Local News | wyomingnews.com",
    "text": "CHEYENNE – The Wyoming Highway Patrol, in tandem with the Colorado State Patrol, on Tuesday worked a commercial carrier traffic operation known as a Mobile Enforcement and Education Team detail on the Wyoming-Colorado border.\nThe MEET detail consisted of multiple checkpoints where troopers and mobile inspectors ensured commercial carriers were following state and federal regulations. The operation took place south of Laramie on U.S. Highway 287.",
